      "seed": 79142397,
      "version": 1252,
      "versionNonce": 225461555,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791156057983,
      "created": 1791143582499,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How:\n????\n(preferably some lightweight web-scraping\npython package. If not possible, maybe proper\nweb-search?)\n\nWhen V1:\n1 - Vecto DB is empty;\n2 - Whenever website \"version\" meta-tag\nchanges. Have to always look-up this \"version\"\nbefore procceeding with retrieval.\n\nWhen V2:\nOnly whenever contents of FAQ structured data\nactually change (an HTML script tag with\nstringified JSON as it's contents).\n\nWhen v1 vs When v2:\nWill depend on which is faster...",
      "fontSize": 16.885496494410283,
      "baseFontSize": 40.88549649441028,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "24ZJlrJb9ipMs5HyPrq9y",
      "originalText": "How:\n????\n(preferably some lightweight web-scraping python package. If not possible, maybe proper web-search?)\n\nWhen V1:\n1 - Vecto DB is empty;\n2 - Whenever website \"version\" meta-tag changes. Have to always look-up this \"version\" before procceeding with retrieval.\n\nWhen V2:\nOnly whenever contents of FAQ structured data actually change (an HTML script tag with stringified JSON as it's contents).\n\nWhen v1 vs When v2:\nWill depend on which is faster...",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
